Maintainer: Somanos Sar <somanos.sar@drumee.com>
Standards-Version: 3.1.3
Homepage: https://drumee.org

Package: drumee-ui-pod
Architecture: all
# No component dependencies, and no build tooling — see the note in
# static/debian/control for the full reasoning.
#
# The webpack bundles in this package were produced when the package was built; nothing
# compiles at install time, so binutils, git and nodejs were build-time leftovers.
#
# `Depends: drumee-server-pod` also used to carry the install ORDER: the server had to
# be configured before the UI. That is no longer true — drumee-server-pod 2.9.95 moved
# its service start into a self-interest dpkg trigger, which dpkg runs once every other
# package in the transaction is configured, whatever the dependency graph says. The
# trigger's own comment names this dependency as one of the two bugs it works around.
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Drumee User Interface
